<title>GERMANY: Buba sets June reserve goal at 39.8 bln dmk.</title>
<headline>Buba sets June reserve goal at 39.8 bln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Monday that its preliminary minimum reserve goal for the month of June is 39.8 billion marks.</p>
<p>German banks are required to keep certain funds in non-interest bearing accounts at the central bank and the Bundesbank sets its so-called reserve goal every month.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
